#     (Firebase Console → Authentication → Sign-in method → Google)
#   - Android client ID: create an OAuth client of type "Android", package name
#     com.pulseapp.mobile (see packages/mobile/app.json), SHA-1 from your debug
#     keystore or `eas credentials` for release builds
GOOGLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_ANDROID_CLIENT_ID=
